OL,3,GNEWSASix in court accused of high-value
OL,4,APokemon card theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix men charged over the theft of
OL,7,Fhigh-value Pokemon cards from a
OL,8,Fwarehouse in Nottinghamshire have
OL,9,Fappeared in court.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said a group
OL,12,Fallegedly drilled through the wall of a
OL,13,Fbusiness premises in Aurillac Way,
OL,14,FRetford, before stealing 26 boxes of
OL,15,Fcards in December.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
